--!strict
--[[
	MapShared.RegionAtmosphere - per-region mood presets + region lookup (shared by the client
	switcher and the editor preview).

	Look: one gritty junkyard world (smog-filtered, contrasty, desaturated) with a
	distinct mood per region. Technique taken from the reference world (World_8248288152): a low
	sun (its Brightness is 0.34) under very bright ambient (Ambient 217,211,206 / OutdoorAmbient
	255,244,211) with +0.4 exposure, so shadows are soft and readable and interiors (the dome
	town, houses, the Menders lobby) are never black; a strong ColorCorrection grade, haze-heavy
	Atmosphere, and a high Bloom threshold so only lanterns and neon bloom.

	Region volumes live in ReplicatedStorage.MapRegionVolumes (generated by MapGen): Parts with
	attributes Region (string), Priority (number) and optional Shape="Cylinder" + Radius.
]]

